[00:10.56]1. Your glory, God, your mighty works abound,
[00:20.25]In skies above, their praise for you resounds.
[00:30.05]Creation speaks without a voice or word;
[00:43.48]In all the earth, its message can be heard.
[00:49.48]Creation speaks without a voice or word;
[00:59.48]In all the earth, its message can be heard.
[01:09.88]2. True wisdom starts with wholesome fear of you
[01:19.10]And guards our way in all we say and do.
[01:29.08]Your wise commands enlighten young and old—
[01:38.59]A treasure far exceeding finest gold.
[01:48.39]Your wise commands enlighten young and old—
[01:58.36]A treasure far exceeding finest gold.
[02:22.94]3. By knowing you, our life is not in vain,
[02:32.73]And by your word, our life will be sustained.
[02:42.91]The greatest honor anyone can gain
[02:52.32]Will come to all who sanctify your name.
[03:02.32]The greatest honor anyone can gain
[03:23.68]Will come to all who sanctify your name.